abstract: >-
  Explicit certified bounds on the full complex odd theta–Weil form domain,
  with retained positive energy, complete residual coupling and arithmetic
  tails. A quantitative equality-vector obstruction limits the fixed positive
  comparison. Lean checks the abstract proof chain and exact rational
  consequences conditional on explicitly identified analytical and numerical
  realization inputs.
keywords:
  - Weil form
  - theta function
  - verified computation
  - residual estimates
  - Lean
